		<a class="dc-img-link" href="/these-bash-shortcuts-save-me-hours-of-terminal-typing/" >
	
	<div class="w-img "
			>
                        					<div class="bc-img responsive-img img-displayCard">
								

				
				
				
				                <picture><source
